# gfx-vis -- W2-GA visual acceptance shots on the default lobby map (hillbtwn,
# URBAN): ore/gems drawn (W2-GA-01), no black hole by the start (W2-GA-04),
# clean ore mine + tree shadows (06/08), map lighting (05), the Guardian GI and
# Terror Drone SHP art (10/11), vehicle shadows (12), the deployed base with the
# war-factory / defence art. Fog of war off: an explored enemy stays drawn (03).
# Shots are for human comparison with the original; asserts only check the
# state the shots need.
set render_every 300
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click combo:ai1
click "pick:Medium Enemy"
click start
until 90 scene == game
require scene == game
shot v01_start
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
cheat credits 60000
cheat spawn GGI 0 building 0:GACNST +6 +0
cheat spawn GGI 0 building 0:GACNST +6 +1
cheat spawn DRON 0 building 0:GACNST +6 +2
cheat spawn MTNK 0 building 0:GACNST +5 +4
cheat spawn HTNK 1 building 0:GACNST +8 +5
wait 3
view building 0:GACNST
shot v02_units
assert units(0,GGI) >= 2
assert units(0,DRON) >= 1
click tab:0
click cameo:GAPOWR
until 900 queue_ready(structure) == 1
click cameo:GAPOWR
place auto
until 120 built(0,GAPOWR) == 1
click tab:0
click cameo:GAREFN
until 1800 queue_ready(structure) == 1
click cameo:GAREFN
place auto
until 300 built(0,GAREFN) == 1
click tab:0
click cameo:GAPILE
until 900 queue_ready(structure) == 1
click cameo:GAPILE
place auto
until 300 built(0,GAPILE) == 1
click tab:0
click cameo:GAWEAP
until 1800 queue_ready(structure) == 1
click cameo:GAWEAP
place auto
until 300 built(0,GAWEAP) == 1
click tab:1
click cameo:NASAM
until 1800 queue_ready(defense) == 1
click cameo:NASAM
place auto
until 300 built(0,NASAM) == 1
# w7 (fv7a): the Medium AI's first tank group shells the base from weapon
# range by ~f1100. A human house's idle units neither answer a building's
# call for help [RE: FUN_00707500 -- computer helpers only] nor see past
# weapon range + 1 in Guard, so the passive base fell before the v03/v04
# shots. Defend it as a player would: band-select the army, G = Guard Area
# (2x weapon range, W6-02-11 [RE: GuardObject FUN_0072FE30]).
view building 0:GACNST
drag xy 30 30 1080 690
key g
let tanks = units(0,MTNK)
click tab:3
click cameo:MTNK
until 1500 units(0,MTNK) > $tanks
wait 6
view building 0:GACNST
drag xy 30 30 1080 690
key g
view building 0:GAWEAP
view building 0:GAWEAP
shot v03a_door
wait 900
view building 0:GAWEAP
shot v03_base
view building 0:NASAM
shot v03b_patriot
wait 1200
view building 0:GACNST
shot v04_later
end
